# Review Pull Request

Analyze and review a GitHub pull request using the automated PR review toolkit.

## Usage

```powershell
# Run from project root
tools/pr-review/review_pr.ps1 <PR_NUMBER>

# Example
tools/pr-review/review_pr.ps1 437
```

## What This Does

The script will:
1. Fetch the PR branch
2. Update origin/main
3. Find the merge-base (common ancestor)
4. Show commits in the PR
5. Display file changes with statistics
6. Check if PR needs rebasing
7. Show visual commit graph
8. Provide next-step commands

## After Analysis

Use the submit script to write and submit your review:
```powershell
tools/pr-review/submit_review.ps1 <PR_NUMBER> <approve|changes|comment>
```

